political side and you said, that's

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.000
here. But here I actually just want to

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.200
have regular talks, a regular

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.240
conversation. When did you make the

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.250
choice? Right. Because in stand up, you

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.220
have comedians that make the choice to

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.500
take the turn and go political and

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.020
start to address real issues, real

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.600
problems. When was it that you made a

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.070
decision to say, you know what, man?

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:27.840
Like and being funny is great, but I'm

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:28.950
