00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:31.170
narrative and start to address my funny

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.940
with a clever approach to talking about

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.410
the problems that I see in the country.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:34.950
Right.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.070
Well, again, like the other thing, it's

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.770
an evolution that I almost couldn't

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.870
stop from happening because my father

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:45.090
was in news. My father was a radio

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:47.400
newsman in the day when every news

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.710
station in the radio had news at the

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.720
